<p>After a long and exhaustive trip from Antwerp to Berlin we arrived well at this nice jazz club in Berlin Mitte and played for a very attentive audience. It&#8217;s a treat to experience the band becoming more and more locked-in every night.</p>
<p>Wednesday was out first day off in Berlin. No duties whatsoever.</p>
